240
00:15:54,660 --> 00:15:57,360
For some reason, he
hasn't activated it yet.

241
00:15:58,080 --> 00:16:02,877
Wait, come to think of it, I haven't launched
one attack since he played that card.

242
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:06,397
I bet he's planning to use it to
make one of my attacks backfire.

243
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:08,160
So it must be Mirror Force.

244
00:16:08,460 --> 00:16:12,931
If I'm right, then there might be a way
I can take down those Egyptian gods.

245
00:16:13,260 --> 00:16:15,120
But it's not going to be easy.

246
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:18,120
I need to play the right card combination.

247
00:16:18,340 --> 00:16:21,280
So everything is riding on this next draw.

248
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:24,468
Well, heart of the
cards, you know the deal.

249
00:16:24,860 --> 00:16:25,690
Guide me.

250
00:16:26,160 --> 00:16:28,120
Alright, now!

251
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:30,980
My move, and I have a plan!

252
00:16:31,340 --> 00:16:32,500
Good, then go!

253
00:16:32,820 --> 00:16:34,760
Yugi's not gonna attack, right?

254
00:16:35,300 --> 00:16:36,130
Nah!

255
00:16:36,213 --> 00:16:41,520
For starters, my Silent Swordsman jumps
one more notch from level 4 to level 5!

256
00:16:43,700 --> 00:16:48,260
And then I'll activate Valkyra,
the Magna Warrior's special effect!

257
00:16:48,740 --> 00:16:50,152
You see, whenever Alpha,

258
00:16:50,340 --> 00:16:54,657
Beta, and Gamma, the Magnet Warriors,
are in my graveyard at the same time,

259
00:16:54,740 --> 00:16:59,420
I can bring them all back to the
field by sacrificing my Valkyra!

260
00:17:00,180 --> 00:17:02,020
He's completely lost it.

261
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:05,657
Why on earth would Yugi dismantle
one of his most powerful

262
00:17:05,740 --> 00:17:09,505
monsters just to summon three
weaker monsters to take its place?

263
00:17:19,660 --> 00:17:23,860
Whenever you summon a new monster,
Slifer's special ability activates.

264
00:17:25,740 --> 00:17:27,760
What are you thinking, Yu-Gi?

265
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:31,294
Now every one of your monsters
gets blown off the field.

266
00:17:33,100 --> 00:17:34,380
Lightning blast!

267
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,940
So far, so good.

268
00:17:39,260 --> 00:17:41,780
I activate my Magnet Force trap!

269
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:46,680
What's this?

270
00:17:46,980 --> 00:17:50,857
I can activate Magnet Force
whenever one of my rock-or-machine

271
00:17:50,940 --> 00:17:54,646
monsters is targeted by the
special ability of another monster.

272
00:17:55,020 --> 00:17:59,440
Once activated, this trap card transfers
Slifer's Blast to your monsters.

273
00:17:59,820 --> 00:18:02,900
He's turning the Egyptian
gods against themselves.

274
00:18:04,580 --> 00:18:06,780
Is this move really gonna work?

275
00:18:16,280 --> 00:18:18,917
He weakened them by 2,000 points.

276
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:23,500
Now Yu-Gi Swordsman can take on
any one of those Egyptian god-gods!

277
00:18:23,700 --> 00:18:26,040
Silent Swordsman, it's time to attack!

278
00:18:26,640 --> 00:18:30,440
Destroy Obelisk the Tormentor
with Silent Sword Slash!

279
00:18:32,100 --> 00:18:33,960
Not so fast, Yu-Gi!

280
00:18:34,260 --> 00:18:35,880
I activate my trap card!

281
00:18:36,520 --> 00:18:38,440
Behold, my Mirror Force!

282
00:18:39,080 --> 00:18:40,060
No way!

283
00:18:53,320 --> 00:18:54,600
It's over, Yugi.

284
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:57,400
Aw, man.

285
00:18:57,700 --> 00:18:59,320
All his monsters are gone.

286
00:18:59,840 --> 00:19:02,300
Dude, this can't be happening. Yugi!

287
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:05,440
He came closer than I thought possible.

288
00:19:06,380 --> 00:19:07,210
Yeah,

289
00:19:07,293 --> 00:19:11,921
well, close doesn't count, so in my book,
Yugi's still the same loser he always was.

290
00:19:12,500 --> 00:19:13,500
What a joke.

291
00:19:13,860 --> 00:19:16,200
Once again, you've all wasted my time.

292
00:19:16,540 --> 00:19:18,117
That was a valiant effort, Yugi.

293
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:21,160
If only you had predicted
my face down card.

294
00:19:21,520 --> 00:19:24,680
I did, and that's why
this duel's not done!

295
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:28,097
As soon as your Mirror Force
Trap card was activated,

296
00:19:28,180 --> 00:19:31,592
I was able to complete the
card combination that I needed!

297
00:19:32,060 --> 00:19:37,260
Pharaoh, it's about time I eliminated
those Egyptian God cards! But how?
